      "episode": 6,
      "number": 6,
      "released": "2013-03-25T00:00:00.000Z",
      "overview": "Jun gets caught for illegal trading and his father is forced to punish him. Since Jun handled Lee Jeong-chan's funeral, he gets interrogated on the whereabouts of Lady Da-hee.",
      "thumbnail": "https://episodes.metahub.space/tt6428718/1/6/w780.jpg",
      "moviedb_id": 944937
    },
    {
